up: aurum-go
  /var/lib/docker/volumes/aurumcode-gocache/_data -> /gocache
  <bind-mount> -> <home>/repos/AurumCode
  <bind-mount> -> /tmp/claude-1000/office-wt
  <home>/go/pkg/mod-aurumcode -> /go/pkg/mod
exit_code=0
RESULTADO: o container monta o cache de modulos do projeto e o volume de build
